      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "We describe a rare case of multiple myeloma with marked hypointense areas on both T1- and T2-weighted images. Amyloid deposition and calcification were not found histologically. Hypointensity on T2-weighted images may be caused by distributed free radicals produced by significant macrophages."},
